  "body": "## What's Changed\r\nTl;dr: minor fixes; mac os crash and general UX\r\n* refactor(tui): bump ratatui and simplify the usage by @orhun in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/33\r\n* feat(ci): add build, test and clippy by @SoptikHa2 in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/34\r\n* Update inotify dependency from 0.10.0 to 0.11.0 by @musicinmybrain in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/35\r\n* Bump ratatui dependency to 0.29 by @LecrisUT in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/36\r\n* Fix typos by @kianmeng in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/37\r\n* docs(readme): contributing and LLM notice by @SoptikHa2 in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/38\r\n* fix: crash on mac os by @SoptikHa2 in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/41\r\n* deps: update by @SoptikHa2 in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/42\r\n* version 1.2.3 by @SoptikHa2 in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/43\r\n* feat: use alternate screen buffer to not clear screen on exit by @SoptikHa2 in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/44\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @orhun made their first contribution in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/33\r\n* @musicinmybrain made their first contribution in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/35\r\n* @LecrisUT made their first contribution in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/36\r\n* @kianmeng made their first contribution in https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/pull/37\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/SoptikHa2/desed/compare/v1.2.2...v1.2.3",
